WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.077 --> 00:00:01.055
- I'm just making you look like

00:00:01.055 --> 00:00:03.317
a long-lost member of My Chemical Romance.

00:00:03.317 --> 00:00:05.399
You just went through some hard times.

00:00:05.399 --> 00:00:08.899
(upbeat orchestral music)

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:12.060
I have never done men's hair before.

00:00:12.060 --> 00:00:14.132
I don't really have any men in my life

00:00:14.132 --> 00:00:15.874
that need their hair done by me.

00:00:15.874 --> 00:00:17.416
- I feel like it's gonna be easier

00:00:17.416 --> 00:00:18.282
'cause there's less of it.

00:00:18.282 --> 00:00:19.270
- How hard could it be?

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:21.186
I have 10 times the hair that you have.

00:00:21.186 --> 00:00:22.481
- We're gonna find out how hard it is

00:00:22.481 --> 00:00:23.314
to do guys' hair.
- No.

00:00:23.314 --> 00:00:25.386
- The rules are no cutting
allowed, and no dying allowed.

00:00:25.386 --> 00:00:26.423
But everything else is fair game.

00:00:26.423 --> 00:00:29.479
- Today for your hair, I'm
going for just woke up,

00:00:29.479 --> 00:00:30.386
kind curly.

00:00:30.386 --> 00:00:32.669
- So like in K-dramas when
like those people wake up,

00:00:32.669 --> 00:00:33.668
they look flawless.
- Yes!

00:00:33.668 --> 00:00:34.845
- Without anything.
- Yes!

00:00:34.845 --> 00:00:36.829
- The most majestic, beautiful creature

00:00:36.829 --> 00:00:38.431
that I know is a peacock.

00:00:38.431 --> 00:00:40.520
I'm gonna like stand it up in the back,

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:42.231
hopefully have some glitter.

00:00:42.231 --> 00:00:43.698
- I'm gonna try a braid.

00:00:43.698 --> 00:00:45.926
If I can't, maybe I'll
part it in the middle.

00:00:45.926 --> 00:00:47.468
(laughing)

00:00:47.468 --> 00:00:49.118
(upbeat music)

00:00:49.118 --> 00:00:50.393
- At least your hair will smell good.

00:00:50.393 --> 00:00:52.027
Not so much like look great.

00:00:52.027 --> 00:00:53.411
- 'Cause that's what every guy wants,

00:00:53.411 --> 00:00:55.040
hair that just smells good.

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:56.471
- My hair's really not hard to play with.

00:00:56.471 --> 00:00:58.446
- I'm gonna crank this up to 450 degrees.

00:00:58.446 --> 00:01:00.500
- 450 degrees, is that even legal?

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:01.975
- Oh it looks kinda cool from the back.

00:01:01.975 --> 00:01:02.919
- Can you see it from the front?

00:01:02.919 --> 00:01:04.329
- I don't know if I can
do it from the front.

00:01:04.329 --> 00:01:06.654
- This is more complicated
than I anticipated.

00:01:06.654 --> 00:01:07.957
- It's very close to my face.

00:01:07.957 --> 00:01:09.724
(laughs)
It's making smoke!

00:01:09.724 --> 00:01:10.829
- That's the product burning off.

00:01:10.829 --> 00:01:12.073
- That's supposed to happen, making sure.

00:01:12.073 --> 00:01:14.517
- Braid is a cool look, but
you can't see it as much.

00:01:14.517 --> 00:01:15.748
Of course I feel like this

00:01:15.748 --> 00:01:17.240
is a look.
- Loud and proud.

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.995
- You step into the clurb, and
you're like I have arrived!

00:01:19.995 --> 00:01:21.523
- When I go clurbing.
- Yeah.

00:01:21.523 --> 00:01:23.707
- Oh, oh, oh, you can't clurb that hard.

00:01:23.707 --> 00:01:26.097
- You're like that character
from Dragon Ball Z right now.

00:01:26.097 --> 00:01:27.546
- If she gave me Goku hair today,

00:01:27.546 --> 00:01:28.893
I'd be pretty okay with that.

00:01:28.893 --> 00:01:30.505
- I'm hearing this noise,
my hair is pulling out.

00:01:30.505 --> 00:01:31.828
- What, no!
(laughs)

00:01:31.828 --> 00:01:32.783
I don't think so.

00:01:32.783 --> 00:01:34.224
- It's not really standing up, though.

00:01:34.224 --> 00:01:35.833
'Cause you have heavy hair.

00:01:35.833 --> 00:01:37.367
Men's hair, heavier than you think.

00:01:37.367 --> 00:01:38.717
- You really are starting to look like

00:01:38.717 --> 00:01:40.215
a K-drama star, though.

00:01:40.215 --> 00:01:41.327
It's kinda creeping me out.

00:01:41.327 --> 00:01:42.160
- I don't think this would even make

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:43.128
a really good Halloween look.

00:01:43.128 --> 00:01:45.123
- It would, if you were
dressing up like a peacock.

00:01:45.123 --> 00:01:48.054
- I've always been like so
intrigued by men's products,

00:01:48.054 --> 00:01:49.766
like these gels and these waxes.

00:01:49.766 --> 00:01:50.781
They're quite elaborate.

00:01:50.781 --> 00:01:51.614
- I'm actually excited

00:01:51.614 --> 00:01:54.697
to find out that my hair can do this.

00:01:56.028 --> 00:01:58.009
(groaning)
(laughing)

00:01:58.009 --> 00:01:58.940
- Woah!
- Do I look like a poodle?

00:01:58.940 --> 00:02:00.190
What is happening to my hair?

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:02.177
- His hair is quite heavy and thick.

00:02:02.177 --> 00:02:03.988
They just kinda all fall down.

00:02:03.988 --> 00:02:05.701
- I see green.

00:02:05.701 --> 00:02:06.623
- Okay, so guys' hair

00:02:06.623 --> 00:02:08.617
is a little bit weirder
than I anticipated.

00:02:08.617 --> 00:02:11.634
You have to like be so
specific with each bit.

00:02:11.634 --> 00:02:13.228
- And then I'm just
gonna gather these bits,

00:02:13.228 --> 00:02:14.127
'cause why not.

00:02:14.127 --> 00:02:15.370
You look like a cute troll.

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:16.801
- Oh.
(laughs)

00:02:16.801 --> 00:02:18.786
- Do you see the amount
of glitter falling?

00:02:18.786 --> 00:02:21.275
(laughs)
- Holy crap!

00:02:21.275 --> 00:02:23.478
- God, men's products are quite difficult.

00:02:23.478 --> 00:02:25.298
I have a lot of respect for men now.

00:02:25.298 --> 00:02:26.587
- Okay, I think it's done.

00:02:26.587 --> 00:02:27.420
- Is it done?

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:28.323
- Alright, are you ready to see?

00:02:28.323 --> 00:02:29.411
- Can I see the mirror?

00:02:29.411 --> 00:02:30.945
(upbeat whistling music)

00:02:30.945 --> 00:02:32.324
(laughing)

00:02:32.324 --> 00:02:34.289
- You look great.

00:02:34.289 --> 00:02:36.539
(laughing)

00:02:37.381 --> 00:02:39.360
- Okay, I'm not hating, for sure.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:42.221
- What the hell is that?
(laughs)

00:02:42.221 --> 00:02:44.560
- This is not a good look
to walk down the street.

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:46.200
- But a good look for a concert.

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:47.065
- But, yeah.

00:02:47.065 --> 00:02:48.908
- I've never seen my
hair like this, curled.

00:02:48.908 --> 00:02:50.555
- You look dapper, man.
- 'Cause I have like,

00:02:50.555 --> 00:02:52.004
the straightest hair possible.

00:02:52.004 --> 00:02:53.243
- You have some really straight hair.

00:02:53.243 --> 00:02:55.173
- Even when you think a guy has long hair,

00:02:55.173 --> 00:02:57.270
their hair is a lot less manageable.

00:02:57.270 --> 00:03:00.498
- My biggest difficulty with
this project was his attitude.

00:03:00.498 --> 00:03:01.924
He was just not open.

